      "message": "fix(build): clippy 1.100 needless_range_loop on main\n\nclippy 1.100 (the PR-test runner's toolchain) flags four indexed loops\non main as needless_range_loop, which turns `-D warnings` red for every\nPR there: three in camcraft-geometry's feature.rs (481, 1205, 1486) and\none in camcraft-sim's fixture_mesh_convict test (152). Each is now an\niterator loop over the same elements (`e.facets.iter().take(n)` /\n`moves.iter().enumerate().take(3)`); no behaviour change, and the facet\nloops no longer index a fixed array.\n\nFixes #1624\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
